1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
一壶油打翻，成就一座城的早饭
A spilled oil jug birthed a city's breakfast

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
武汉，热干面
Wuhan — hot-dry noodles

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
1930年代，汉口街头
1930s, on Hankou's streets

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,200
面煮好、拌油、晾干
Boiled, tossed in oil, air-dried

5
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,400
第二天一烫，香得冒油
Reheated next day — fragrant with oil

6
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,600
灵魂：浓稠芝麻酱
The soul: thick sesame paste

7
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,800
深翻浅覆，高挑低搅
Toss high, fold low, coat every strand

8
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,000
蔡明纬加了它，1937
Cai Mingwei added it, 1937

9
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,200
双木成林，得名蔡林记
Two trees make a forest — Cai Lin Ji

10
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,400
武汉人管早餐叫「过早」
Wuhan calls breakfast guò zǎo

11
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,600
拌开的那一下，你饿了吗？
That first toss — are you hungry yet?

12
